      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "const data = $input.first().json;\nconst old1 = '- **Fixed release actions** are supported for operator-configured repositories: `release_tag` can create/push a validated release tag at the captured clean `main` HEAD, and `publish_npm` can dispatch one fixed GitHub Actions publication workflow without exposing generic Git/workflow arguments.';\nconst new1 = '- **Fixed npm release actions** are supported for operator-configured npm/`package.json` repositories: `release_tag` can create/push a validated release tag at the captured clean `main` HEAD after matching the root `package.json` version, and `publish_npm` can dispatch one fixed GitHub Actions publication workflow without exposing generic Git/workflow arguments. These built-ins are intentionally narrower than the repository-generic Repo Ops surface.';\nconst old2 = 'The release workflow attaches the product wheel, Agent Bridge wheel, Windows native abi3 wheel, and the skills-only `serverfs-plugin-v0.23.0.zip`; their SHA-256 values are appended automatically to the GitHub Release body after the tag workflow completes.';\nconst new2 = 'The published release attaches the product wheel, Agent Bridge wheel, Windows native abi3 wheel, and the skills-only `serverfs-plugin-v0.23.0.zip`; their SHA-256 values were appended automatically to the GitHub Release body by the tag workflow.';\nif (typeof data.body !== 'string') throw new Error('GitHub Release body missing');\nif (data.body.split(old1).length - 1 !== 1) throw new Error('Expected release-action sentence exactly once');\nif (data.body.split(old2).length - 1 !== 1) throw new Error('Expected release-asset sentence exactly once');\nreturn [{ json: { body: data.body.replace(old1, new1).replace(old2, new2) } }];"
      }
    },
